### Response Format:

**If the method CANNOT return null at this specific call site:**
```xml
<response>
  <reason><![CDATA[EXPLAIN WHY THE INVOCATION mth.getEnterBlock() RESULT CANNOT BE NULL.]]></reason>
  <value>NO</value>
</response>
```

**If the method CAN return null at this specific call site:**
